# Keep the build context lean + deterministic. The image fetches its own Linux Tailwind CLI, so the
# host's tools/ (which may hold a Windows tailwindcss.exe) must not leak in. Build outputs + VCS +
# local logs/captures are never needed for the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
tools/
.git/
.github/
**/logs/
**/captures/
**/*.user
docs/
*.md
!EggIncognito/Endpoints/**
